{"about_the_game":"Mine and combine gems for your defenses. Play Arcade Mode and accompany Lou on a journey to save the Star Babies.<br><br>Gems and rocks can be placed anywhere.  It's up to you how you place them.  Build a path of rocks and powerful gem towers to defeat the enemy waves &amp; Bosses.  Strategic placement, Combining Gems, Utilizing Lou effectively, and timely use of Star Baby's abilities are key to success.<br> <br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>    Command Lou!<br></li><li>    Combine gems to make new towers<br></li><li>    Unique Player Abilities<br></li><li>    Tower Defense / RPG Hybrid<br></li><li>    Achievements, Leaderboards<br></li><li>    Full Controller Support<br></li><li>    Tutorial<br></li><li>    Arcade Mode<br></li><li>    Story Mode (new!)<br></li><li>    Sparkles<br></li><li>    Free to Play</li></ul><br>Arcade Mode: Each round mine gems and keep one. Combine gems &amp; defend as Lou to clear as many rounds as possible. Enemies (and Lou) grow in strength each round but so do the rewards.<br><br>Story mode: Accompany Lou on a journey to save the Star Babies.  Available now.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"eb28b1b29e0f2862960c4c09f9a52bac88c8ca46.jpg","localized_name":"Level 1 Complete","name":"Level 1 Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1047480/eb28b1b29e0f2862960c4c09f9a52bac88c8ca46.jpg"},{"icon":"eb28b1b29e0f2862960c4c09f9a52bac88c8ca46.jpg","localized_name":"Level 2 Completed","name":"Level 2 Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1047480/eb28b1b29e0f2862960c4c09f9a52bac88c8ca46.jpg"},{"icon":"eb28b1b29e0f2862960c4c09f9a52bac88c8ca46.jpg","localized_name":"Tutorial Completed","name":"Tutorial Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1047480/eb28b1b29e0f2862960c4c09f9a52bac88c8ca46.jpg"},{"icon":"eb28b1b29e0f2862960c4c09f9a52bac88c8ca46.jpg","localiz